# SQLite WAL-mode sidecar files. `*.db` alone does not match these, which is how
# ledger.db-shm and ledger.db-wal ended up untracked-but-visible in the tree.
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Local tooling state. Nothing here belongs to the project, and this repository is
# public: assistant/editor scratch directories carry local settings, transient
# worktrees and session notes. It has never been committed - this line is so that
# staying uncommitted does not depend on nobody ever running `git add -A`.
.claude/
